ind":"announcement","title":"Leafborn gameplay","summary":"We’re streaming Leafborn gameplay live on loop.In Leafborn you control a character made of thousands of leaves. Shift forms, turn into a tornado, smash like a hammer. Every skill works differently in every form. Parkour across floating islands and stop the Nulls, the robots stealing your world’s energy.Every run is different and you build your own loadout.If you like what you see, adding Leafborn to your wishlist helps a lot. The playtest is open too, so jump into our Discord and tell us what yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:35:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4247440-1838407329267484","game_id":"steam-4247440","kind":"announcement","title":"Leafborn Is Growing: New Team, New Look, New Features!","summary":"Hi everyone!Leafborn is now being developed by a team of three. While I continue working on the technical side, two artists are helping shape the game’s characters, environments, and overall visual style.Leafborn is becoming more stylized, vibrant, and unique. You can see some of our latest work below.You can support Leafborn on Patreon to access exclusive content, special Discord roles and channels, and future early playtests.Thank you for supporting us!Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/cw/Leafb","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T20:45:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329267484","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4247440-1834602721186520","game_id":"steam-4247440","kind":"announcement","title":"Leafborn Featured on Famitsu & Denfaminicogamer! 🇯🇵","summary":"Hello everyone!I have some absolutely mind-blowing news to share with you all. Over the past few days, Leafborn has received an overwhelming amount of love and attention from players and media in Japan!I am incredibly honored to announce that major Japanese gaming outlets like Famitsu and Denfaminicogamer have featured Leafborn! Seeing my game covered by such legendary publications is a dream come true for me as an indie developer.To all my new players coming from Japan, and to everyone who has ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T04:13:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721186520","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4247440-1831432155568405","game_id":"steam-4247440","kind":"announcement","title":"Where to Follow Leafborn's Journey","summary":"If you want to follow Leafborn's journey more closely, see what's being built each week, or just hang out with people who love the game, here's where the community is gathering:🌿 Discord — The heart of it all. Early gameplay clips, design polls, direct feedback into development, and a place to chat with me and other players in real time. This is where the most exclusive looks land first. https://discord.gg/J9mUnDV4tP🌿 Twitter / X — Quick development updates, technical breakdowns, and whatever I'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-30T14:34:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155568405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4247440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4247440":"2026-10-26T